# Build-context filter of orchestrator/Dockerfile. The context is the repository root (docker-bake.hcl) and
# BuildKit uses this Dockerfile-specific file instead of the root .dockerignore, so it allowlists exactly what the
# image needs: the orchestrator sources, the Go sources of the scantor binary, schemas/ and docs/guide/.

**

!go.mod
!go.sum
!embed.go
!cmd/
!internal/
!schemas/
!scaffolds/
!docs/guide/
!orchestrator/

# Local state, outputs and dependency trees (installed inside the image)
orchestrator/node_modules
orchestrator/.nuxt
orchestrator/.output
orchestrator/.data
orchestrator/test
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
